        <com:Annotations><com:Annotation><com:AnnotationType>METHODOLOGY</com:AnnotationType><com:AnnotationText xml:lang="en">chstat/BADAC counting: one observation unit per signatory canton of an agreement (signatories = cantons publishing the text plus cantons named in titles). Observations with TIME_PERIOD &lt;= 2003 are computed from the Swiss Law Collection's collections — no scaling, no external baseline. chstat.ch/BADAC's 2003 figure (2,522 memberships &lt;= 2003) is an external comparison reference only; the computed value is lower because long-repealed agreements were delisted upstream.</com:AnnotationText></com:Annotation></com:Annotations>
